{"id":"cecotec-pizza-de-coliflor-en-cecofry","sourceUrl":"https://cecotec.es/recetas/cecofry/pizza-de-coliflor-en-cecofry","publishedAt":"2024-04-17T16:34:05+02:00","name":{"es":"Pizza de coliflor","en":"Cauliflower pizza"},"description":{"es":"","en":""},"appliances":["cecofry"],"course":"main","tags":["cecofry","main"],"baseServings":2,"servingsMax":null,"servingsUnit":"comensales","servingsText":"2","minutes":30,"minutesSource":"cecotec","timeBucket":"le30","difficulty":"easy","difficultySource":"estimated","kcalPerServing":null,"photoUrl":"https://ecom-media-manager-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/image/cc0609d8-fa94-42fd-a6ca-d1998561b3d1.jpg","cookedCount":0,"ingredients":[{"ingredientId":"sal","quantity":null,"unit":null,"toTaste":true,"optional":false,"group":{"es":"Para la masa","en":"For the base"},"note":null,"sourceText":"Sal"},{"ingredientId":"huevo","quantity":1,"unit":"ud","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":{"es":"Para la masa","en":"For the base"},"note":null,"sourceText":"1 huevo"},{"ingredientId":"queso-crema","quantity":1,"unit":"tbsp","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":{"es":"Para la masa","en":"For the base"},"note":null,"sourceText":"1 cucharada de queso crema"},{"ingredientId":"coliflor","quantity":320,"unit":"g","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":{"es":"Para la masa","en":"For the base"},"note":null,"sourceText":"320 g de coliflor"},{"ingredientId":"queso-rallado","quantity":null,"unit":null,"toTaste":true,"optional":false,"group":{"es":"Para el relleno","en":"For the filling"},"note":null,"sourceText":"Queso rallado"},{"ingredientId":"oregano","quantity":null,"unit":null,"toTaste":true,"optional":false,"group":{"es":"Para el relleno","en":"For the filling"},"note":null,"sourceText":"Orégano"},{"ingredientId":"salsa-de-tomate","quantity":null,"unit":null,"toTaste":true,"optional":false,"group":{"es":"Para el relleno","en":"For the filling"},"note":null,"sourceText":"Salsa de tomate"},{"ingredientId":"mozzarella-fresca","quantity":null,"unit":null,"toTaste":true,"optional":false,"group":{"es":"Para el relleno","en":"For the filling"},"note":null,"sourceText":"Mozzarella fresca"},{"ingredientId":"cherrys","quantity":null,"unit":null,"toTaste":true,"optional":false,"group":{"es":"Para el relleno","en":"For the filling"},"note":null,"sourceText":"Cherrys"},{"ingredientId":"champinon","quantity":null,"unit":null,"toTaste":true,"optional":false,"group":{"es":"Para el relleno","en":"For the filling"},"note":null,"sourceText":"Champiñón"}],"steps":[{"text":{"es":"Rallamos la coliflor. Dejamos la coliflor sobre un paño, apretamos para eliminar el líquido.","en":"Grate the cauliflower. Leave the cauliflower on a cloth, press to remove the liquid."}},{"text":{"es":"Mezclamos la coliflor con el queso crema, el huevo y una pizca de sal.","en":"Mix the cauliflower with the cream cheese, the egg and a pinch of salt."}},{"text":{"es":"Formamos la base de la pizza sobre papel de horno, cocinamos en la Cecofry a 180ºC durante 10 minutos.","en":"Shape the pizza base on baking paper, cook in the Cecofry at 180 °C for 10 minutes."},"timerMinutes":10,"temperatureC":180},{"text":{"es":"Añadimos la salsa de tomate, el queso rallado, la mozzarella, los tomates partidos por la mitad y el champiñón laminado, programamos 200ºC durante 8 minutos.","en":"Add the tomato sauce, the grated cheese, the mozzarella, the tomatoes halved and the sliced mushroom, set to 200 °C for 8 minutes."},"timerMinutes":8,"temperatureC":200},{"text":{"es":"Servimos con un poco de orégano espolvoreado.","en":"Serve with a little oregano sprinkled on top."}}]}